        "key": "q-duplicate-callbacks",
        "question": "How does Order Notifier handle repeated deliveries of the same callback (for example, retries from the payment provider)?",
        "rationale": "Operations notes say that nothing was noted about repeated deliveries of the same callback, leaving it unclear whether the Callback Receiver and Channel Poster are idempotent. This affects whether duplicate or replayed callbacks could cause inconsistent or misleading order status updates.",
